    "detailed_description": "Stellaxy is a space exploration RPG adventure game with a massive Universe with over a billion planets to explore!<br><br><br>You are the first astronaut being sent out  to be an ambassador of Earth. Your mission is to explore the Universe for anomalies spotted by scientists back home.<br><br>Discover aliens that span across the once thought cold dead universe, and learn about their cultures. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your ship to make it a killing machine, or to your visual liking. <br></li><li>Fight against tyrannical alien races that have taken over many solar systems throughout the universe! <br></li><li>Trade with the peaceful species and learn about them. <br></li><li>Complete all the challenges to 100% the game. <br></li><li>93 Achievements to unlock<br></li><li>Complete quests given to you by allies! <br></li><li>Over 40 different alien species to learn about!<br></li><li>Procedurally generated textures!<br></li><li>Runs on basically ANY PC!  <br></li><li>Collect 250+ unique items!<br></li><li>Visit Parallel Universes!<br></li><li>Discover the Mysteries of the Stellaxy Universe!<br></li><li>Create fun and interesting mods for the community to try!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Stellaxy is a space exploration RPG adventure game with a massive Universe with over a billion planets to explore!<br><br><br>You are the first astronaut being sent out  to be an ambassador of Earth. Your mission is to explore the Universe for anomalies spotted by scientists back home.<br><br>Discover aliens that span across the once thought cold dead universe, and learn about their cultures. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your ship to make it a killing machine, or to your visual liking. <br></li><li>Fight against tyrannical alien races that have taken over many solar systems throughout the universe! <br></li><li>Trade with the peaceful species and learn about them. <br></li><li>Complete all the challenges to 100% the game. <br></li><li>93 Achievements to unlock<br></li><li>Complete quests given to you by allies! <br></li><li>Over 40 different alien species to learn about!<br></li><li>Procedurally generated textures!<br></li><li>Runs on basically ANY PC!  <br></li><li>Collect 250+ unique items!<br></li><li>Visit Parallel Universes!<br></li><li>Discover the Mysteries of the Stellaxy Universe!<br></li><li>Create fun and interesting mods for the community to try!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stellaxy is a space exploration immersive sim with alien cultures, boss battles, and massive Universes containing billions of planets to explore! Discover the mysteries of the Universes and find collectibles while completing quests.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Greek, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA fascinating top-down space exploration game with combat elements. It's got some weirdness to it, but it also seems to be trying to a Starflight vibe, which I definitely appreciate.\u201d<br>RECOMMENDED \u2013 Space Game Junkie<br><br>\u201cAs an astronaut sent out into the depths of space, explore over a billion planets and meet alien life. Lo-fi in the best way possible and weirdly addictive.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Weird F'n Games<br><br>\u201cIt's a nice little indie game about space exploration. You navigate through the universe, sending probes to mine minerals, sell them and buy many upgrades for you and your ship. Relaxed fun!\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Space Experience<br>",
